<title>CANADA: Canada C$1.3 bln bond due 2027 yields 7.299 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$1.3 bln bond due 2027 yields 7.299 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$1.3 billion auction of 8.0 percent bonds due June 1, 2027 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     7.299     108.495  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     7.291     108.599  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    7.314     108.301   62.5</p>
<p>Bids from primary dealers totalled C$3,044.25 million, including C$63.75 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield. The bonds will be dated and delivered on February 3. The debt issue now totals C$5.8 billion.</p>
<p>((Jeffrey Hodgson (416) 941-8105, e-mail: jeffrey.hodgson@reuters.com))</p>
